  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.2.2p4\n\nBuild id: 9427783\n\nDescription of the bug:\nThe game crashes (both Oculus and Steam release, both in VR mode and Desktop mode, even after reinstalling VRChat), when you get close to an world object that can be grabbed.\nIn previous versions, the game worked fine without crashing.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nGo in any world\nGet close to any grabbable object\nThe game freeze for a few seconds, and then crash before even showing the object outline\n\nI know my specs are suboptimal but the game used to work last week...\nCPU: Intel i5 8th gen\nGPU: NVIDIA GTX 1050",
